a and the Director of Prosecution (DPP) Mr. Biswalo Mganga signing vistors books after the launching of the National Prosecutions Services Office for Nzega District in Tabora','Mkuu wa Wilaya ya Nzega Mhe. Godfrey Ngupura na Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka (DPP) bw. Biswalo Mganga wakitia saini vitabu vya wageni baada ya uzinduzi wa Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashitaka wilayani Nzega mkoani Tabora','Nzega District Commissioner, Godfrey Ngupura and the Director of Prosecution (DPP) Mr. Biswalo Mganga signing vistors books after the launching of the National Prosecutions Services Office for Nzega District in Tabora','Mkuu wa Wilaya ya Nzega Mhe. Godfrey Ngupura na Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka (DPP) bw. Biswalo Mganga wakitia saini vitabu vya wageni baada ya uzinduzi wa Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashitaka wilayani Nzega mkoani Tabora','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1532431070-4.jpg','','1532431070-4-jpg',0,1,1,'2018-07-24 08:17:50','2018-07-24 08:17:50'),(184,'Prime Minister Hon. Kasim Majaliwa cutting the strip as a sign of launching the Attorney General\'s office, the National Prosecution\'s Office and the Office of the of Solicitor General in the capital Dodoma. ','Waziri Mkuu Mhe. Kasim Majaliwa akikata utepe ikiwa ni ishara ya kuzindua ofisi ya Mwanasheria Mkuu wa Serikali, Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka na Ofisi ya Wakili Mkuu wa Serikali . Uzinduzi huo ulifanyika eneo la Chuo Kikuu cha Dodoma ambako ndiko iliko  Ofi','Prime Minister Hon. Kasim Majaliwa cutting the strip as a sign of launching the Attorney General\'s office, the National Prosecution\'s Office and the Office of the of Solicitor General in the capital Dodoma. ','Waziri Mkuu Mhe. Kasim Majaliwa akikata utepe ikiwa ni ishara ya kuzindua ofisi ya Mwanasheria Mkuu wa Serikali, Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka na Ofisi ya Wakili Mkuu wa Serikali . Uzinduzi huo ulifanyika eneo la Chuo Kikuu cha Dodoma ambako ndiko iliko  Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka kwa sasa katika jiji la Dodoma.','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1534750772-5.jpg','','1534750772-5-jpg',0,1,1,'2018-08-20 04:39:32','2018-08-20 04:39:32'),(186,'Minister for Constitution and Legal Affairs Hon. Prof. Palamagamba Kabudi showing a list of former directors of Public Prosecutions attached to the wall to hon. Prime Minister Mr. Kasim Majaliwa when he visited National Prosecutor\'s Office after launching','Waziri wa Katiba na Sheria Prof. Palamagamba Kabudi alienyoosha mkono akimuonyesha Waziri Mkuu Mhe. Kasim Majaliwa orodha ya waliopata kuwa Wakurugenzi wa Mashtaka nchini katika orodha iliyobandikwa ukutani baada ya kuzindua Ofisi ya Mwanasheria Mkuu wa S','Minister for Constitution and Legal Affairs Hon. Prof. Palamagamba Kabudi showing a list of former directors of Public Prosecutions attached to the wall to hon. Prime Minister Mr. Kasim Majaliwa when he visited National Prosecutor\'s Office after launching the Attorney General\'s Office, the National Prosecutor\'s Office and the Office of the Attorney General in the capital Dodoma.','Waziri wa Katiba na Sheria Prof. Palamagamba Kabudi alienyoosha mkono akimuonyesha Waziri Mkuu Mhe. Kasim Majaliwa orodha ya waliopata kuwa Wakurugenzi wa Mashtaka nchini katika orodha iliyobandikwa ukutani baada ya kuzindua Ofisi ya Mwanasheria Mkuu wa Serikali, Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka na Ofisi ya Wakili Mkuu wa Serikali jijini Dodoma','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1534751382-11.JPG','','1534751382-11-jpg',0,1,1,'2018-08-20 04:49:43','2018-08-20 04:49:43'),(190,'Director of Public Prosecution Mr. Biswalo Mganga holding white paper addresing Press in the Capital Dodoma','Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka nchini (DPP) Bw. Biswalo Mganga aliyeshika karatasi akiongea na waandishi wa habari jijini Dodoma','','','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1563263839-Pix 3 DPP.jpg','','1563263839-pix-3-dpp-jpg',0,1,1,'2019-07-16 04:57:19','2019-07-16 04:57:19'),(195,'Minister for Constitution and Legal Affairs Hon. Dr. Augustine Mahiga (left) handing set of Publications to Vice President Hon. Samia Suluhu Hassan to launch them at the 10th years Annivessary of ARINSA held in Dar es Salaam at JNICC ',' Waziri wa Katiba na Sheria Mhe. Dkt. Augustine Mahiga akimkabidhi Makamu wa Rais Mhe. Samia Suluhu Hassan Machapisho ya ARINSA ili ayazindue  wakati wa maadhimisho ya miaka 10 ya ARINSA yaliyofanyika jijini Dar es Salaam.','','','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1563268376-Arinsa 61.jpg','','1563268376-arinsa-61-jpg',0,1,1,'2019-07-16 06:12:56','2019-07-16 06:12:56'),(196,'Vice president Hon. Samia Suluhu Hassan showing a publication she lauched during the 10th year Annivessary of  ARINSA held in Dar es Salaam at Julius Nyerere International Conference Center',' Makamu wa Rais Mhe. Samia Suluhu Hassan akionyesha kitabu alichozindua wakati wa maadhimisho ya miaka 10 ya ARINSA yaliyofanyika jijini Dar es Salaam','','','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1563268796-arinsa 31.jpg','','1563268796-arinsa-31-jpg',0,1,1,'2019-07-16 06:19:56','2019-07-16 06:19:56'),(198,'Vice President Hon. Samia Suluhu Hassan addressing 10th Anniversary Commemorations held in Dar es Salaam','Makamu wa Rais Mhe. Samia Suluhu Hassan akizungumza wakati wa maadhimisho ya miaka 10 ya ARINSA yaliyofanyika jijini Dar es Salaa.','\r\n','','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1563270104-arinsa 11.jpg','','1563270104-arinsa-11-jpg',0,1,1,'2019-07-16 06:41:44','2019-07-16 06:41:44'),(200,'Director of Public Prosecution Mr. Biswalo Mganga  with Permanent Secretary Treasury Mr. Dotto James holding foreign currencies seized from economic crime cases handled by the office of National prosecutions in Dar es Salaam','Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka nchini (DPP) Bw. Biswalo Mganga pamoja na Katibu Mkuu Hazina Bw. Dotto James wakiwa wameshika fedha za kigeni zilizotokana na kesi za uhujumu uchumi zilizoendeshwa na Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka (NPS) na Mahakama kuamuru zitaifishwe','','','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1563271636-gold 21.jpg','','1563271636-gold-21-jpg',0,1,1,'2019-07-16 07:07:17','2019-07-16 07:07:17'),(201,'Ministers holding pieces of Gold during the event of handing over of gold, foreign currencies and germ stones which comes from economic crime cases done by DPP to the Permanent Secretary Treasury held at The Bank of Tannzania Offices in Dar es Salaam','Baadhi ya Mawaziri walioshuhudia tukio la kukabidhi Fedha za kigeni, Dhahabu na Madini ya vito vilivyotokana na kesi za uhujumu uchumi  kulikofanywa na DPP kwa Katibu Mkuu Hazina jijini Dar es Salaam','','','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1563272178-gold 11.jpg','','1563272178-gold-11-jpg',0,1,1,'2019-07-16 07:16:18','2019-07-16 07:16:18'),(203,'KENYA WAKABIDHI DHAHABU KWA MHE. RAIS','KENYA WAKABIDHI DHAHABU KWA MHE. RAIS','Wawakilishi wa Jamhuri ya Kenya wakimkabidhi Mheshimiwa Rais Dkt. John Pombe Magufuli  dhahabu zilizokua zimetoroshwa kutoka Tanzania kwenda nchini Kenya ambazo Kenya walizirudisha nchini ili zitumike kama kielelezo kwenye kesi iliyofunguliwa Mwanza','Wawakilishi wa Jamhuri ya Kenya wakimkabidhi Mheshimiwa Rais Dkt. John Pombe Magufuli  dhahabu zilizokua zimetoroshwa kutoka Tanzania kwenda nchini Kenya ambazo Kenya walizirudisha nchini ili zitumike kama kielelezo kwenye kesi iliyofunguliwa Mwanza','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1566992382-IMG-20190822-WA0091.jpg','','1566992382-img-20190822-wa0091-jpg',0,1,1,'2019-08-28 08:39:42','2019-08-28 08:39:42'),(204,'Alichosema Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka Mr Biswalo Mganga   Baada ya Mheshimiwa Rais Dkt JohnPombe Magufuli  Kuwaombea Msamaha Wahujumu Uchumi','Alichosema Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka Mr Biswalo Mganga   Baada ya Mheshimiwa Rais Dkt JohnPombe Magufuli  Kuwaombea Msamaha Wahujumu Uchumi','The Director of Public Prosecutions (DPP), Biswalo Mganga said his office was ready to act on the advice of President Magufuli who wanted to be heard by detainees facing economic misconduct if they were willing to confess and return government money to be pardoned.\r\nThe DPP said this was possible if the defendant personally wrote a letter to the Prosecutor\'s Office and insisted that the letter should be written by the suspect himself in prison and not the lawyer.\r\n\"The order is that, the inmate himself is required to write a letter to the prison officer acknowledging the offense and asking for repentance as soon as possible and we will take action.\r\n“Only the defendant should write a letter, not an attorney. You know the lawyer can change and even suspect that I have not sent him to do what he did on my behalf, that is why the suspects who always apologize and confess write their own handwriting through the head of the prison ”said DPP Mganga.\r\nSpeaking yesterday during the swearing in of some of his elected officials, President Magufuli called on the DDP within seven days to look into the possibility of pardoning some of the long-held suspects for economic misconduct \r\n','Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka Nchini (DPP), Biswalo Mganga amesema ofisi yake ipo tayari kutekeleza ushauri wa Rais Magufuli aliyetaka kusikilizwa kwa mahabusu wanaokabiliwa na makosa ya uhujumu uchumi iwapo watakuwa tayari kukiri na kurejesha fedha za serikali wasamehewe.\r\nMganga amesema jambo hilo linawezekana endapo mshtakiwa mwenyewe ataiandikia ofisi yake barua kupitia kwa Mkuu wa Gereza na kusisitiza kuwa barua hiyo inapaswa kuandikwa na mtuhumiwa mwenyewe aliye gerezani na siyo wakili.\r\n“Utaratibu ni kwamba, mtuhumiwa mwenyewe aliyeko mahabusu anatakiwa aniandikie barua kupitia kwa mkuu wa gereza akikiri kosa na kuomba kutubu haraka iwezekanavyo na sisi tutachukua hatua.\r\n“Ni mtuhumiwa mwenyewe ndiye anatakiwa kuandika barua, siyo wakili. Unajua wakili anaweza kubadilika na hata mtuhumiwa kumkana kuwa sijamtuma afanye alichofanya kwa niaba yangu, ndiyo maana mara zote watuhumiwa wanaoomba msamaha na kukiri huandika barua wenyewe kwa mkono wao kupitia kwa mkuu wa gereza” Amesema DPP Mganga.\r\nAkizungumza jana wakati wa kuwaapisha baadhi ya viongozi aliowateua, Rais Magufuli alimuomba DDP ndani ya siku saba kuangalia uwezekano wa kusamehewa baadhi ya watuhumiwa waliokaa muda mrefu mahabusu kwa makosa ya uhujumu uchumi endapo watatubu, akisema anatamani kuona Watanzania wote wanaishi huru ili kushiriki ujenzi wa taifa.\r\n\r\n','image/png','/uploads/gallery/','','1569316475-DPP.png','','1569316475-dpp-png',0,1,1,'2019-09-24 06:14:35','2019-09-24 07:03:54'),(205,'Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka (DPP) Bw. Biswalo Mganga akizungumza katika hafla ya kumkabidhi taarifa ya utekelezaji Mhe. Rais Ikulu jijini Dar es Salaam','Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka (DPP) Bw. Biswalo Mganga akizungumza katika hafla ya kumkabidhi taarifa ya utekelezaji Mhe. Rais Ikulu jijini Dar es Salaam','Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka (DPP) Bw. Biswalo Mganga akizungumza katika hqafla ya kumkabidhi taarifa ya utekelezaji wa ushauri alioutoa  Rais wa Jamhuri ya Muungano wa Tanzania Dkt. John Magufuli wa kuwasamehe watuhumiwa wa uhujumu uchumi walio tayari kutubu na kurejesha fedha na mali kwenye hafla fupi iliyofanyika Ikulu jijini Dar es salaam Septemba 30, 2019','Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka (DPP) Bw. Biswalo Mganga akizungumza katika hqafla ya kumkabidhi taarifa ya utekelezaji wa ushauri alioutoa  Rais wa Jamhuri ya Muungano wa Tanzania Dkt. John Magufuli wa kuwasamehe watuhumiwa wa uhujumu uchumi walio tayari kutubu na kurejesha fedha na mali kwenye hafla fupi iliyofanyika Ikulu jijini Dar es salaam Septemba 30, 2019','image/jpeg','/uploads/gallery/','','1569919317-9.jpg','','1569919317-9-jpg',0,1,1,'2019-10-01 05:41:58','2019-10-01 05:41:58'),(206,'Rais wa Jamhuri ya Muungano wa Tanzania Dkt. John Pombe Magufuli akiangalia taarifa aliyokabidhiwa na Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka (DPP)Biswalo Mganga','Rais wa Jamhuri ya Muungano wa Tanzania Dkt. John Pombe Magufuli akiangalia taarifa aliyokabidhiwa na Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka (DPP)Biswalo Mganga',' Rais wa Jamhuri ya Muungano wa Tanzania Dkt. John Pombe Magufuli akiangalia taarifa ya utekelezaji wa ushauri alioutoa wa kuwasamehe watuhumiwa wa uhujumu uchumi walio tayari kutubu na kurejesha fedha na malialiyoipokea kutoka kw