000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-01-31T11:43:32.000000Z\"}','2023-01-31 08:44:44','2023-01-31 08:44:44'),(97,6,'WelcomeNote','update','154.118.227.58','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/welcome/2','{\"id\":2,\"summary_en\":\"The Management of the National Prosecutions Office, would like to invite all stakeholders to the website of the National Prosecution services.\",\"summary_sw\":\"Uongozi na Menejimenti nzima pamoja na Wafanyakazi wa Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka, wanawakaribisha  wadau wote ndani na nje ya nchi kutembelea Tovuti ya ofisi kwa ajili ya kupata na kujua juu ya taarifa mbalimbali ambazo ofisi inashughulika nayo. karibuni \",\"content_sw\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">edit Uongozi na Menejimenti nzima pamoja na Wafanyakazi wa Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka, unapenda kuwakaribisha wadau wote kwenye Tovuti ya ofisi. Tovuti hii imesanifiwa kiufundi na maalum kwa ajili ya kutoa taarifa kwa wadau ndani na nje ya nchi juu ya masuala ya uendeshaji wa mashtaka.<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p>edit The overall management and management of the National Prosecutor&#39;s Office, you would like to invite all stakeholders to the office of the Office. This site is dedicated to technical and specific information for reporting to both domestic and international stakeholders on prosecution issues......<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"status\":\"1\",\"created_at\":\"2023-01-18T16:41:11.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2022-08-07T16:13:16.000000Z\"}','2023-01-31 08:48:33','2023-01-31 08:48:33'),(98,6,'WelcomeNote','update','154.118.227.58','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/welcome/2','{\"id\":2,\"summary_en\":\"The Management of the National Prosecutions Office, would like to invite all stakeholders to the website of the National Prosecution services.\",\"summary_sw\":\"Uongozi na Menejimenti nzima pamoja na Wafanyakazi wa Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka, wanawakaribisha  wadau wote ndani na nje ya nchi kutembelea Tovuti ya ofisi kwa ajili ya kupata na kujua juu ya taarifa mbalimbali ambazo ofisi inashughulika nayo. karibuni \",\"content_sw\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">Uongozi na Menejimenti nzima pamoja na Wafanyakazi wa Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka, unapenda kuwakaribisha wadau wote kwenye Tovuti ya ofisi. Tovuti hii imesanifiwa kiufundi na maalum kwa ajili ya kutoa taarifa kwa wadau ndani na nje ya nchi juu ya masuala ya uendeshaji wa mashtaka.<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p>The overall management and management of the National Prosecutor&#39;s Office, you would like to invite all stakeholders to the office of the Office. This site is dedicated to technical and specific information for reporting to both domestic and international stakeholders on prosecution issues......<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"status\":\"1\",\"created_at\":\"2023-01-31T14:48:33.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-01-31T11:48:33.000000Z\"}','2023-01-31 08:49:08','2023-01-31 08:49:08'),(99,6,'RelatedLink','store','154.118.227.58','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/related_links','{\"title_sw\":\"Voluptatum debitis a\",\"title_en\":\"Porro libero magni a\",\"link\":\"1\",\"url_external\":null,\"url\":\"administration\\/ministerial-advisory-board\"}','2023-01-31 08:52:03','2023-01-31 08:52:03'),(100,6,'RelatedLink','destroy','154.118.227.58','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/related_links/35','{\"id\":35,\"title_sw\":\"Voluptatum debitis a\",\"title_en\":\"Porro libero magni a\",\"link\":1,\"url\":\"administration\\/ministerial-advisory-board\",\"url_external\":null,\"active\":1,\"created_at\":\"2023-01-31T11:52:03.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-01-31T11:52:10.000000Z\",\"parent\":0,\"position\":1}','2023-01-31 08:52:24','2023-01-31 08:52:24'),(101,6,'ImportantLink','store','154.118.227.58','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/important_links','{\"title_sw\":\"Mollitia omnis delec\",\"title_en\":\"Magna dolor proident\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.sopokexovy.tv\"}','2023-01-31 08:52:30','2023-0