"0\",\"status\":\"1\"}','2023-02-02 13:33:44','2023-02-02 13:33:44'),(151,6,'NpsAchievement','update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/nps_achievements/9','{\"id\":9,\"created_at\":\"2023-02-02T16:33:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-02-02T16:33:44.000000Z\",\"fin_year_id\":\"2\",\"achievement_type_id\":\"4\",\"count\":\"103\",\"status\":\"1\"}','2023-02-02 13:34:19','2023-02-02 13:34:19'),(152,6,'News','store','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/news','{\"title_en\":\"eGA Yaanika Misingi ya Serikali Mtandao\",\"title_sw\":\"eGA Yaweka hadharani Misingi ya Serikali Mtandao\",\"content_en\":\"<p>TASAC yashiriki bonanza la michezo kwa wafanyakazi wake ikiwa ni mkakati wa kujenga mahusiani mazuri katika maeneo ya kazi na kuimarisha afya za wafanyakazi. Bonanza lilifunguliwa na Mkurugenzi Mkuu wa TASAC ambapo michezo mbalimbali ilichezwa ikiwa ni pamoja na kukimbiza kuku, kukimbia kwenye gunia, kuruka kamba, kukimbia, kuvuta kamba, kukimbia kwenye gonna, kucheza mpira wa miguu na mpira wa pete. Wafanyakazi walishiriki kikamilifu na kuonesha vipaji vyao.<\\/p>\",\"content_sw\":\"<p>TASAC yashiriki bonanza la michezo kwa wafanyakazi wake ikiwa ni mkakati wa kujenga mahusiani mazuri katika maeneo ya kazi na kuimarisha afya za wafanyakazi. Bonanza lilifunguliwa na Mkurugenzi Mkuu wa TASAC ambapo michezo mbalimbali ilichezwa ikiwa ni pamoja na kukimbiza kuku, kukimbia kwenye gunia, kuruka kamba, kukimbia, kuvuta kamba, kukimbia kwenye gonna, kucheza mpira wa miguu na mpira wa pete. Wafanyakazi walishiriki kikamilifu na kuonesha vipaji vyao.<\\/p>\",\"active\":\"1\",\"photo_url\":\"24ed46d9143bd95ae84c51ee336d5b16.jpeg\",\"user_id\":6,\"slug\":\"ega-yaanika-misingi-ya-serikali-mtandao\"}','2023-02-02 13:44:35','2023-02-02 13:44:35'),(153,6,'News','update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/news/168','{\"id\":168,\"title_sw\":\"eGA Yaweka hadharani Misingi ya Serikali Mtandao\",\"title_en\":\"eGA Yaanika Misingi ya Serikali Mtandao\",\"summary_sw\":\"\",\"summary_en\":null,\"content_sw\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">TASAC yashiriki bonanza la michezo kwa wafanyakazi wake ikiwa ni mkakati wa kujenga mahusiani mazuri katika maeneo ya kazi na kuimarisha afya za wafanyakazi. Bonanza lilifunguliwa na Mkurugenzi Mkuu wa TASAC ambapo michezo mbalimbali ilichezwa ikiwa ni pamoja na kukimbiza kuku, kukimbia kwenye gunia, kuruka kamba, kukimbia, kuvuta kamba, kukimbia kwenye gonna, kucheza mpira wa miguu na mpira wa pete. Wafanyakazi walishiriki kikamilifu na kuonesha vipaji vyao.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/demo81.eganet.go.tz\\/nps\\/uploads\\/gallery\\/1667992377-_05A5204.JPG\\\" style=\\\"height:400px; width:600px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">TASAC yashiriki bonanza la michezo kwa wafanyakazi wake ikiwa ni mkakati wa kujenga mahusiani mazuri katika maeneo ya kazi na kuimarisha afya za wafanyakazi. Bonanza lilifunguliwa na Mkurugenzi Mkuu wa TASAC ambapo michezo mbalimbali ilichezwa ikiwa ni pamoja na kukimbiza kuku, kukimbia kwenye gunia, kuruka kamba, kukimbia, kuvuta kamba, kukimbia kwenye gonna, kucheza mpira wa miguu na mpira wa pete. Wafanyakazi walishiriki kikamilifu na kuonesha vipaji vyao.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/demo81.eganet.go.tz\\/nps\\/uploads\\/gallery\\/1667992377-_05A5204.JPG\\\" style=\\\"height:400px; width:600px\\\" \\/><\\/p>\",\"active\":\"1\",\"user_id\":6,\"slug\":\"ega-yaanika-misingi-ya-serikali-mtandao\",\"photo_url\":\"24ed46d9143bd95ae84c51ee336d5b16.jpeg\",\"created_at\":\"2023-02-02T16:44:35.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-02-02T16:44:35.000000Z\"}','2023-02-02 13:47:15','2023-02-02 13:47:15'),(154,6,'Translation','trans_update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/trans_update','{\"id\":27,\"keyword\":\"lbl_latest_news\",\"en\":\"Latest News\",\"sw\":\"Habari Mpya\",\"created_at\":\"2020-04-17T09:41:00.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-04-17T09:41:00.000000Z\"}','2023-02-02 13:49:29','2023-02-02 13:49:29'),(155,6,'Translation','trans_update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/trans_update','{\"id\":30,\"keyword\":\"lbl_news\",\"en\":\"Updates\",\"sw\":\"Habari\",\"created_at\":\"2020-04-17T09:41:00.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-04-17T09:41:00.000000Z\"}','2023-02-02 13:49:29','2023-02-02 13:49:29'),(156,6,'Translation','trans_update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/trans_update','{\"id\":35,\"keyword\":\"lbl_more_news\",\"en\":\"More News\",\"sw\":\"Habari Zaidi\",\"created_at\":\"2020-04-17T09:41:00.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-04-17T09:41:00.000000Z\"}','2023-02-02 13:49:29','2023-02-02 13:49:29'),(157,6,'Translation','trans_update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/trans_update','{\"id\":46,\"keyword\":\"lbl_view_all_news\",\"en\":\"View All News\",\"sw\":\"Soma Habari zaidi\",\"created_at\":\"2020-04-17T09:41:00.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-04-17T09:41:00.000000Z\"}','2023-02-02 13:49:29','2023-02-02 13:49:29'),(158,6,'Translation','trans_update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/trans_update','{\"id\":341,\"keyword\":\"lbl_news_and_events\",\"en\":\"News & Events\",\"sw\":\"Habari na Matukio\",\"created_at\":\"2020-04-17T09:41:00.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2022-06-14T06:23:27.000000Z\"}','2023-02-02 13:49:29','2023-02-02 13:49:29'),(159,6,'MenuItem','update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/menu-items/196','{\"id\":196,\"title_sw\":\"Taarifa kwa Vyombo vya Habari\",\"title_en\":\"Press Release\",\"status\":0,\"menu_id\":\"8\",\"url\":\"press-releases\",\"url_external\":null,\"link\":\"1\",\"parent\":195,\"position\":1,\"has_sidebar\":0,\"created_at\":\"2018-06-26T18:36:17.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-02-02T14:02:14.000000Z\"}','2023-02-02 13:55:03','2023-02-02 13:55:03'),(160,6,'WelcomeNote','update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/welcome/2','{\"id\":2,\"summary_en\":\"The Management of the National Prosecutions Office, would like to invite all stakeholders to the website of the National Prosecution services.\",\"summary_sw\":\"Uongozi na Menejimenti nzima pamoja na Wafanyakazi wa Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka, wanawakaribisha  wadau wote ndani na nje ya nchi kutembelea Tovuti ya ofisi kwa ajili ya kupata na kujua juu ya taarifa mbalimbali ambazo ofisi inashughulika nayo. karibuni \",\"content_sw\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">Uongozi na Menejimenti nzima pamoja na Wafanyakazi wa Ofisi ya Taifa ya Mashtaka, unapenda kuwakaribisha wadau wote kwenye Tovuti ya ofisi. Tovuti hii imesanifiwa kiufundi na maalum kwa ajili ya kutoa taarifa kwa wadau ndani na nje ya nchi juu ya masuala ya uendeshaji wa mashtaka.<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p>The overall management and management of the National Prosecutor&#39;s Office, you would like to invite all stakeholders to the office of the Office. This site is dedicated to technical and specific information for reporting to both domestic and international stakeholders on prosecution issues......<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"status\":\"1\",\"created_at\":\"2023-01-31T14:49:08.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-01-31T11:49:08.000000Z\"}','2023-02-02 14:05:59','2023-02-02 14:05:59'),(161,6,'Administration','store','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/administration','{\"salutation_sw\":\"Dkt.\",\"salutation_en\":\"Dr.\",\"fullname\":\"Jesca Joel\",\"title_sw\":\"Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka\",\"title_en\":\"Director Public Prosecutions\",\"email\":\"admin@nps.go.tz\",\"phone\":\"000\",\"position\":\"1\",\"content_sw\":\"<p>hjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjj<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p>hgiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii<\\/p>\",\"photo_url\":\"df5d1e90b6487fbc5f2029fe46089605.jpeg\",\"slug\":\"jesca-joel\"}','2023-02-02 14:08:15','2023-02-02 14:08:15'),(162,6,'Administration','update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/administration/21','{\"id\":21,\"salutation_en\":\"Mr\",\"salutation_sw\":\"Bw\",\"fullname\":\"Sylvester A Mwakitalu\",\"position\":\"0\",\"title_sw\":\"Mkurugenzi Mkuu\",\"title_en\":\"Director\",\"content_sw\":\"<p>Ndugu. Sylvester Mwakitalu , aliteuliwa tarehe 11, Mei 2021 na Rais wa Jamhuri ya Muungano wa Tanzania, Mhe. Samia Suluhu Hassan kuwa Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p>Mr.Sylvester Mwakitalu , was appointed on 11, May ,2021 by the President of the United Republic of Tanzania, Hon. Samia Suluhu Hassan to be the Director of Public Prosecutions<\\/p>\",\"photo_url\":\"00a265c5e3bbc4096ea848f11f3e9857.png\",\"email\":null,\"phone\":\"099999999\",\"created_at\":\"2022-10-15T17:36:36.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-01-18T18:00:52.000000Z\",\"slug\":\"dg\"}','2023-02-02 14:09:06','2023-02-02 14:09:06'),(163,6,'Administration','update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/administration/21','{\"id\":21,\"salutation_en\":\"Mr\",\"salutation_sw\":\"Bw\",\"fullname\":\"Sylvester A Mwakitalu\",\"position\":\"1\",\"title_sw\":\"Mkurugenzi Mkuu\",\"title_en\":\"Director\",\"content_sw\":\"<p>Ndugu. Sylvester Mwakitalu , aliteuliwa tarehe 11, Mei 2021 na Rais wa Jamhuri ya Muungano wa Tanzania, Mhe. Samia Suluhu Hassan kuwa Mkurugenzi wa Mashtaka<\\/p>\",\"content_en\":\"<p>Mr.Sylvester Mwakitalu , was appointed on 11, May ,2021 by the President of the United Republic of Tanzania, Hon. Samia Suluhu Hassan to be the Director of Public Prosecutions<\\/p>\",\"photo_url\":\"00a265c5e3bbc4096ea848f11f3e9857.png\",\"email\":null,\"phone\":\"099999999\",\"created_at\":\"2022-10-15T17:36:36.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-02-02T17:09:06.000000Z\",\"slug\":\"dg\"}','2023-02-02 14:10:06','2023-02-02 14:10:06'),(164,6,'MenuItem','update','154.118.229.2','http://demo81.eganet.go.tz/nps/cms/menu-items/193','{\"id\":193,\"title_sw\":\"Hotuba\",\"title_en\":\"Speeches\",\"status\":0,\"menu_id\":\"8\",\"url\":\"speech